#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物、壊してやりたいけど…
#. 壊したら大変な事になるんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd love to just smash the stupid thing, but who knows\n"
"what would happen to me if I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…
#. ボクらを監視してるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They've been using these cameras to watch us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、自販機で誰が何を買うのかまで
#. 監視してるのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they watching who buys what from the vending\n"
"machine?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自販機だ…お金は取らないみたいだ。
#. 飲み放題って事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This vending machine doesn't seem to take any money.\n"
"So I guess we can drink as much as we want...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクから、連打してやろうかな！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I kinda hate looking at it... Maybe I should start\n"
"beating up on it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、購買部みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup, this is definitely the school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが店番してたら
#. 即、引き返すけどな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If Monokuma popped here to sell me something, I'd turn\n"
"around and run the other way.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
